-- Features in v1.4 (Full-Map Edition):
--   1. True Map-Wide Visibility (0m .. 1500m+ across ALL 3 Terrain LOD Shaders: High, Mid, Low!)
--   2. Absolute 2048m x 2048m World-Space Coordinates (34 bits/node in 11 float-triplets = 22 nodes,
--      12.5cm exact resolution anywhere on the map, ZERO torus wrap, ZERO distance cutoff!)
--   3. Map-Wide NPC & Mutant Tracking + Full-Journey Adaptive Resampling (fine detail near feet +
--      stretches multi-hundred-meter paths all the way across the entire map!)
--   4. Smooth Per-Frame (dt) Full-Map Campfire Snow Melting & Subtle INVERNO Weapon Frost
-- ==============================================================================================

